{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44063","headline":"古意曲 · 刘瑶","name":"古意曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梧桐阶下月团团，洞房如水秋夜阑。\n吴刀翦破机头锦，茱萸花坠相思枕。\n绿窗寂寞背灯时，暗数寒更不成寝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘瑶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}